    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### How it works\nProcesses a batch of records safely, without duplicates, even when an API call fails. It validates records, removes duplicates, and skips any record already marked \"done\" in Google Sheets. Each record is marked \"pending\" before the API call. On success it is logged and marked \"done\". On failure it stays \"pending\", the error is logged, and an alert email is sent. A final summary counts every result.\n\n### Setup\n1. Create a Google Sheet with tabs: Success log, Error log, Mark processed (columns: record_id, status, updated_at), Invalid record.\n2. In all 6 Google Sheets nodes, replace YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID and YOUR_SHEET_TAB_ID.\n3. Connect your Google Sheets and Gmail credentials.\n4. In Failure Alert, replace your-email@example.com.\n5. In Call API (with Retry), replace the demo URL with your own API.\n\n### Customization\nEdit the test records in Prepare Input Data. Add an idempotency key if your API supports one.\n\nLimitations: a retry after a timeout may create a duplicate if the API has no idempotency key. Workflow crashes are not covered.",
        "height": 752,
        "width": 768,
        "color": "#75590A"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
